      "y": 17742,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "Where |V_Ed| &gt; 0.5 V_pl,Rd, §6.2.2.4(2) reduces the web yield: M_V,Rd = M_Rd − ρ(M_Rd − M_f,Rd),",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_lp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 17767,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "ρ = (2|V_Ed|/V_pl,Rd − 1)². M_f,Rd taken as the steel flanges alone (lower bound; slab ignored).",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
