      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 26222,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "Deck (§6.6.6.4): h_f on a-a is the concrete above the deck; with transverse ribs and k_t, surface b-b need not be checked; a transverse deck continuous across the beam may count as reinforcement on a-a, (6.25).",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_ts",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 26247,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "The flow follows the studs provided (§6.6.6.2(1)), but the slab cannot take more than N_c,f over the shorter shear span: studs beyond full connection add no shear.",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
