      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "Deck: bottom bars A_b lie on the deck, at least 30 mm below the stud head (§6.6.5.1). Not checked: discontinuous deck anchored by the studs (6.26), surfaces c-c / d-d (haunches), splitting at edge beams (§6.6.5.3), anchorage lengths, minimum reinforcement (EC2 §9.2.2(5)), transverse slab bending.",
